OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASwimmer Archie Goodburn thanks prime
OL,4,Aminister as brain cancer review
OL,5,Aannounced
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter the meeting, Burnham announced a
OL,8,Fnew national brain cancer clinical lead
OL,9,Fand promised a review of brain cancer
OL,10,Fprogress and action to get patients
OL,11,Ftreatment sooner.
OL,13,FGoodburn, 25, thanked the prime
OL,14,Fminister and said all three of his
OL,15,Frequests have been "promised to some
OL,16,Fextent" but "fleshing out" needs to be
OL,17,Fdone on the details.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
